type: pros-cons
title: Microservices vs Monolith

- Pros
  - Independent deployments with no shared release coordination
  - Technology flexibility to pick the right tool per service
  - Fault isolation prevents one bad service from taking down the whole app
- Cons
  - Operational complexity: each service needs its own CI pipeline and config
  - Network latency added on every inter-service call
  - Higher infrastructure cost for running multiple isolated runtimes
